{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"The Fairy Tail\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu Dragneel, along with his cat named Happy, has traveled to the town of Hargeon in search of a wizard named Salamander. Here he runs into a young woman named Lucy Heartfilia, a Celestial Wizard, who is determined to join the famous Fairy Tail Guild.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216581.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"妖精の尻尾\"},{\"title\":\"Fire Dragon, Monkey, and Bull\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Happy, and Lucy go in search of a missing Fairy Tail wizard in the mountains from which he never returned. Can they find their fellow Fairy Tail wizard before it's too late?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216651.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"火竜と猿と牛\"},{\"title\":\"Infiltrate the Everlue Mansion\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and Happy team up with Lucy and they accept a job that has a strange and seemingly simple request...enter a mansion owned by Duke Everlue and burn a certain book. Is this job really as easy as it seems?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216661.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"潜入せよ! エバルー屋敷!\"},{\"title\":\"Dear Kaby\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lucy, Natsu and Happy retrieve the book from the mansion, but Lucy cannot bring herself to destroy the book that they have taken the assignment to destroy. What is in the book to prevent her from wanting it destroyed?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216671.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"DEAR KABY[親愛なるカービィへ]\"},{\"title\":\"The Wizard in Armor\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and Lucy start looking for a new job to take, but just then Erza, the strongest female member in all of Fairy Tail, returns. She's so powerful all the other people in Fairy Tail are scared stiff, and she immediately asks Natsu and Gray to come help her on a mission. Lucy tags along to keep the two of them from fighting, and on the train Erza tells the story of how she learned of the evil plans of Eisenwald, a Dark Guild, and how she intends on stopping them. But can the four of them really take on an entire guild by themselves?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216681.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"鎧の魔導士\"},{\"title\":\"Fairies in the Wind\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Erza, Lucy, Happy, and Gray follow the Eisenwald Guild to try and stop them from using the Lullaby, a flute that when played will drain the life out of anyone that hears it. They find them but are lured into a trap set by none other than the Eisenwald leader, Erigor. Can they escape the trap and stop him before he completes his fiendish plan?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216691.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"妖精たちは風の中\"},{\"title\":\"Flame and Wind\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Erza, Gray, Lucy and Happy are trapped in the railroad station by an impenetrable wind barrier created by Erigon. Can they find a way to escape and stop him before he can carry out his plan to destroy the Guild Masters?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216701.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"炎と風\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Team!!!\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu caught up to Erigor after breaking through the magic wind wall, but Natsu's flames aren't able to dent Erigor's perfectly controlled wind! Happy figures out wind's weakness, however, and Natsu uses his Dragon Slayer magic to stage a sudden comeback! After Lucy and the others arrive, everything would seem to be safe, but Kage suddenly takes back the flute and heads towards the Guild Masters! It's just one setback after another; can they ever truly stop the lullaby?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216711.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"最強チーム!!!\"},{\"title\":\"Natsu Devours a Village\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and the others get lost in the depths of Clover Canyon, a great natural labyrinth, on the way back from stopping the dark guild Eisenwald's evil schemes. They stumble upon a suspicious looking village, but don't care as long as they find something to eat! Food comes first! Moving houses, galloping chairs, whatever! As long as they're edible! But this village holds a secret truth...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216721.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツ, 村を食う\"},{\"title\":\"Natsu vs. Erza\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"What a battle! Natsu vs. Erza!! The flames of a Dragon Slayer vs. the armored Fairy Queen! Fairy Tail is expecting fireworks; this guild settles things with their fists! Natsu's all fired up and doesn't give an inch to Erza, but just then... A messenger shows up from the council talking about illegal actions during the Eisenwald incident, and he has an arrest warrant for Erza?!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1216731.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツVSエルザ\"},{\"title\":\"The Cursed Island\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"S class quests... Requests so dangerous only wizards that the master gives permission to go on them. And yet, Natsu, Lucy and Happy go off on one of these S class quests on their own without permission! They head out to \\\"Galuna, the cursed island,\\\" and it turns out the people there are turning into demons from the evil spell of the moon! They learn that there is only one way to undo the curse, and that's to destroy the moon itself! But how in the world are they going to complete a request to \\\"destroy the moon?\\\"\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1445241.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"呪われた島\"},{\"title\":\"Moon Drip\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Lucy, Gray, and Happy uncover a plot to release a demon that wrecked havoc years ago and was only stopped by Gray's former teacher who sacrificed herself to seal away the beast. They meet up with the wizards responsible and a fight breaks out between Gray and a masked wizard who turns out to be Lyon, a person from Gray's past. Meanwhile, Erza makes her way to the island.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1579961.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"月の雫[ムーンドリップ]\"},{\"title\":\"Natsu vs. Yuka the Wave User\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In order to protect the village, Natsu faces off against a new foe, Yuka, who is confident that Natsu will lose to him. Lucy also faces off against a wizard that seems to have her at a big disadvantage...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1579971.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツVS.波動のユウカ\"},{\"title\":\"Just Do Whatever!!\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza has arrived on Galuna Island and her only reason to be there is to return everyone to Fairy Tail for punishment, but Gray refuses to leave and is determined to finish his fight with Lyon.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1579981.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"勝手にしやがれ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Eternal Magic\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gray flashes back to when he first met his teacher and how she changed his life.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1579991.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"永遠の魔法\"},{\"title\":\"The Final Showdown on Galuna Island\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gray is about to use the Iced Shell magic on Lyon to permanently imprison him in ice like Deliora and Natsu must face off against a mysterious foe that uses Lost Magic. Gray considers sacrificing himself to stop Lyon while Natsu battles a mysterious new foe.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1658401.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ガルナ島 最終決戦\"},{\"title\":\"Burst\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The demon, Deliora, has been released! Natsu, Erza, Gray, and Lucy try to stop the demon but it turns out there is no need. Erza, Natsu, Lucy, Gray, and Happy's then turn their attention to helping the villagers.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1658411.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"BURST\"},{\"title\":\"Reach the Sky Above\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza recruits Natsu to help her \\\"destroy the moon\\\" as Lucy and Gray look on with disbelief with the rest of the villagers. Afterward Erza reminds Lucy, Natsu, Gray, and Happy of their impending punishment!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1658431.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"届け あの空に\"},{\"title\":\"Changeling\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu finds a strange looking request on the job board and when he says the words on the paper, he, Lucy, Erza, Gray, Happy, and Loke all switch bodies.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1658451.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"チェンジリング\"},{\"title\":\"Natsu and the Dragon Egg\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"This episode takes us back to when Happy and Natsu first met and when Lisanna was still apart of the gang.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1658461.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツとドラゴンの卵\"},{\"title\":\"The Phantom Lord\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fairy Tail is attacked by Phantom Lord and at first it is just their building, but when some of the Fairy Tail members are brutally attacked, Makarov declares war. While Fairy Tail attacks Phantom Lord's Gajeel waits for Makarov to leave to fight.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1445251.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"幽鬼の支配者\"},{\"title\":\"Lucy Heartfilia\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gajeel starts fighting and ends up in a fight with Natsu. Makarov fights with Phantom Lord Wizard, Jose, and being cathed in one of the Element 4 Magic. He loses his magic power and Fairy Tail army leaves the Phantom Lord. Lucy is rescued from the Phantom Lord guild by Natsu.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1896671.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ルーシィ・ハートフィリア\"},{\"title\":\"15 Minutes\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fairy Tail cures its wounds, whilst Phantom Lord appears in Magnolia. Erza is defeated by one of the most powerful magic force - the magic cannon Jupiter. Jose wants to get back Lucy, but Fairy Tail's guys aren't going to just her over. Magnolia has 15 minutes before Jupiter will fire second time. Natsu rushes into the big cannon of Phantom Lord.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1922731.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"15分\"},{\"title\":\"To Keep from Seeing Those Tears\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Gray, and Elfman have infiltrated Phantom Lord's headquarters. Although Natsu manages to destroy Jupiter and the lookout somehow, Phantom has yet another trump card! Incredibly, the guild itself transforms into the magical giant Phantom Mk II, and starts casting the forbidden magic Abyss Break trying to wipe out the entire guild at once. With no time to spare,Monsieur Sol a member of the Element 4 appears before Elfman!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1922741.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"その涙を見ない為に\"},{\"title\":\"A Flower Blooms in the Rain\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Elfman crushes Sol of the Land, one of the Element 4! Afterwards, the Phantom Mk II seems to slow down for some reason. That's because the giant moves using the power of the Element 4. If all of the Element 4 are defeated, they can stop Abyss Break! There are only two left! Natsu faces off against Aria of the Heavens and Gray faces off against Juvia of the Deep! There's almost no time left until Abyss Break is finished casting!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1922751.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"雨の中に咲く花\"},{\"title\":\"Wings of Flame\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu battles against the strongest member of the Element 4, Aria. Just when things are looking grim, Erza shows up. Aria gets serious and unleashes his full power by taking off his blindfold. Meanwhile Loke goes to rescue Lucy from Gajeel who has started attacking her for fun. Erza makes short work of Aria, but Jose shows up, whose evil magic is more than a match for Erza in her weakened state.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1922761.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"炎の翼\"},{\"title\":\"The Two Dragon Slayers\",\"number\":27,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu finally faces off against Gajeel in an all out battle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968361.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"二人の滅竜魔導士[ドラゴンスレイヤー]\"},{\"title\":\"Fairy Law\",\"number\":28,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Makarov regains his powers and goes to aid in the fight against Phantom. He and Jose face off in a high-level magic battle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968371.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"フェアリーロウ\"},{\"title\":\"My Resolve\",\"number\":29,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The fighting ends, with the help of Fairy Law; after the battle between Natsu and Gajeel, they find they may have more in common than they realized. Will this bring the two enemies closer? Lucy returns to the guild to apologize, and decides to return home to her father. Natsu, Erza, Happy and Grey find her note and follow her. Dressed in fancy clothes and having endless servants as her disposal... will Lucy decide to stay and never return to Fairy Tail again?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968381.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"あたしの決意\"},{\"title\":\"Next Generation\",\"number\":30,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There seems to be a problem with the Master. Is his age finally catching up to him?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968391.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"NEXT GENERATION\"},{\"title\":\"A Star Removed from the Sky\",\"number\":31,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Loki has been acting weird, especially around Lucy. He broke up with all his girlfriends and seems to be dying. Lucy then figures it out, the star that cannot return to the heavens. Loki is stuck on Earth?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968401.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"空に戻れない星\"},{\"title\":\"Celestial Spirit King\",\"number\":32,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Continuing from the previous cliffhanger, Loki is found out to be celestial spirit. He's trapped on earth because he unintentionally killed his contract holder, a grand rule for celestial spirits. Lucy tried to save him, but will it work? The appearance of the Spirit King then brings more trouble!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968411.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"星霊王\"},{\"title\":\"The Tower of Heaven\",\"number\":33,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While on vacation at the Kingdom's best resort, Erza seems to be haunted by glimpses from her past. Erza and Happy are abducted and taken into the Tower of Heaven, to Jellal. Will Natsu and the gang be able to save them? What is the Tower of Heaven and what does it have to do with Erza's past?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968421.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"楽園の塔\"},{\"title\":\"Jellal\",\"number\":34,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It is the start of a big battle where Erza's past starts to unfold and the darkness of the tower of heaven and the R-system are revealed.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968431.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ジェラール\"},{\"title\":\"Voice of Darkness\",\"number\":35,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"This episode takes back to \\\"why\\\" Erza gained her mage skills and what happened to Jellal in the past\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968441.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"闇の声\"},{\"title\":\"Heaven`s Game\",\"number\":36,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"This episode is basically a follow on of what happens in the rebellion and the revolt against Jellal, being that two of his 'comrades' betray him to Erza. Three new enemies appear. Lucy and Juvia seems to find themselves tied up with a very loud enemy, while Natsu on the other hand is fighting with a really \\\"fowl\\\" enemy; who will win this game?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/1968451.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"楽園ゲーム\"},{\"title\":\"Armor of the Heart\",\"number\":37,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The revolt continues; the three enemies prove to be excellent fighters. Lucy is forced to fight Juvia of the Deep and Natsu is eaten. The battle looks grim for team Fairy Tail. We also get to take a peak on Gray's and Erza's relationship with each other when Erza first arrived at Fairy Tail. Meanwhile, Erza is still trapped at Sho's card. Who will come out on top of this twisted game?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2351251.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"心の鎧\"},{\"title\":\"Destiny\",\"number\":38,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Convinced by Siegrain's arguments the magic council prepare to fire the lethal weapon Etherion on the Tower of Heaven. Meanwhile, having beaten the leader of the assassin group Trinity Raven, Erza advances to face Jellal alone.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2351261.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"運命[デスティニー]\"},{\"title\":\"Give Our Prayers to the Sacred Light\",\"number\":39,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"We will now find what is Jellal's plans and the real tower of heaven looks like. Natsu began to confront Jellal, only finding himself overpowered.Natsu starts beating up Jellal, but it was only for Jellal to see his power. Jellal uses a spell to cause him to have incredible speed and then uses another spell with the power of falling meteors.Natsu takes it,then gets up weakly reminding Jellal that the new Tower of Heaven has started to break.Natsu punches the ground and it cracks.\\r\\nThe episode ends with Natsu telling Jellal that breaking things are Fairy Tail's specialty and that he is fired up more than ever now.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2351271.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"聖なる光に祈りを\"},{\"title\":\"Titania Falls\",\"number\":40,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu fights Jellal. Natsu is hardly able to scratch Jellal, having regained his true magical powers. So, deciding to just try and destroy the tower itself, he angers Jellal. Thus he launches the ultimate Heavenly Body Magic, Altairis, deciding to destroy Erza and Natsu together, not minding anymore about the destruction of the Tower. As the attack launched, Simon defended the two and died. Natsu decides to eat some of the lacrima, thinking to absorb the power of Etherion. He unleashes his true Dragon Slayer powers and continues to fight Jellal, but the Etherion, containing elements other than fire, backfired on him. But Natsu managed, and defeated Jellal. As Natsu faints, the unstable power of Etherion started to leak out of the lacrima and it will cause a huge explosion. Erza decides to fuse with the liquified lacrima to save her friends. The Etherion shot out to the sky.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410711.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"妖精女王[ティターニア], 散る\"},{\"title\":\"Home\",\"number\":41,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza is in the sky floating above what looks like her funeral, as everyone is crying and Makarov is saying some words on her behalf. The 10 Wizard saints come and say they have decided to award one of the 2 open titles of one of the 10 Wizard Saints to Erza on her behalf. Natsu comes and screams that Erza is not dead, kicking flowers off of her tomb when everyone subdues him. Erza realizes that this is not what she wanted, she wanted to sacrifice herself to make everyone happy, not to see them all sad. All of a sudden she's on the beach, Natsu holding her in the water with everyone running towards them, happy to see them safe. They go with Sho and the others to invite them to join Fairy Tail, but they end up going their own way. When they get home, Fairy Tail has been rebuilt, with a lot of new additions. Juvia has joined the guild as well, and she brought Gajeel with her. Everyone is upset but Marakov calms them saying it was his decision. Later Gajeel is called out by 2 fairy tail members to the tree where he had attacked them back during the Phantom Lord ordeal to fight. He sits there and takes it without fighting back, when Laxus comes, furious that he is in the guild, and because of what people are now saying about the guild. He bets Gajeel to a pulp when the other fairy tail members realize that he is not fighting back since he wants to accepted. Laxus shoots a bolt of lightning at the girl and Gajeel jumps in front of it taking the hit. Gajeel then walks off, now injured, saying he has work to do.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410721.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"HOME\"},{\"title\":\"Battle of Fairy Tail\",\"number\":42,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Short on money, Lucy decides to compete in the Miss Fairy Contest to win the 500 000 jewel prize, in spite of stiff competition including Mirajane and Cana. However, the contest goes awry when Laxus arrives with his 3 bodyguards, the Raijinshū. Evergreen turns the all the contestants into stone as hostage for Laxus's challenge: the Battle of Fairy Tail. To save the contestants, the entire guild must find Laxus and Raijinshū within three hours and defeat them. However, Fried has set up runes all over Magnolia Town creating traps with specified rules, including one that prevents people over 80 from passing has been set up around the guildhouse.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410731.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"バトル・オブ・フェアリーテイル\"},{\"title\":\"Defeat Your Friends to Save Your Friends\",\"number\":43,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Battle of Fairy Tail moves into high gear, and Fairy Tail members are falling left and right, forced to fight each other to save their friends. With the weakest out of the way, the Raijinshū themselves start to join in. Back at the guildhouse, Makarov, Natsu, and Gajeel are trapped. Frustrated, Natsu serendipidously frees Erza from her stone form allowing her to join the fray. To everyone's amazement, the reclusive Mystogan returns to even the odds.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410741.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"友の為に友を討て\"},{\"title\":\"Thunder Palace\",\"number\":44,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza defeats Evergreen, freeing everyone under the stone spell. Since Laxus has lost his hostages, he takes the whole city hostage with Thunder Palace: lightning lacrimas in the sky that will rain down bolts of lightning and have been enchanted with Body Link Magic, which deals equal damage to the one who attacks it. While Fried is sent to finish off the remaining members of Fairy Tail, Laxus declares he will deal with Erza and Mystogan. Meanwhile, Levy words to dispel the runes around the guildhouse as Lucy and Happy encounter Bixlow. Despite her best efforts, Lucy is overwhelmed and her keys stolen until Loke arrives by his own will to save her and continue the battle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410751.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"神鳴殿\"},{\"title\":\"Advent of Satan\",\"number\":45,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lucy and Loke defeat Bixlow while Cana and Juvia are forced to fight one another because of Fried's runes. Juvia, wishing to be accepted by the guild sacrifices herself by hitting a lightning lacrima, hurting herself for Cana. As Cana fights and loses to Freed, Elfman and Mirajane find them. When Elfman fights and loses to Fried, Mirajane unleashes her power, Satan Soul Take Over, and defeats Fried.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410761.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"サタン降臨\"},{\"title\":\"Clash at Kardia Cathedral!\",\"number\":46,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With all of the Raijinshu defeated, only Laxus remains. Mystogan arrives and holds his own against Laxus, but Erza and Natsu's arrival distracts him, allowing Laxus to attack and reveal Mystogan's face is the same as Jellal's. Mystogan reveals he's not Jellal but he heard of him before departing and leaving Natsu and Erza to finish the fight. Erza, too stunned by the revelation of Mystogan's identity, is ineffective against Laxus and leaves Natsu to fight him while she disables the Thunder Palace.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410771.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! カルディア大聖堂\"},{\"title\":\"Triple Dragons\",\"number\":47,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Erza's magical power is running out, the remaining members of Fairy Tail step in to help disable the Thunder Palace, but are rendered unconscious by the effect of the Body Link Magic afterward. Natsu is overwhelmed by Laxus until Gajeel arrives to even the odds. Laxus reveals that he is also actually a Dragon Slayer and casts the Fairy Law spell. When Levy appears and tells Laxus that Makarov is dying, Laxus responds that his chances of being the Master has increased.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410781.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"トリプル ドラゴン\"},{\"title\":\"Fantasia\",\"number\":48,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After casting Fairy Law, Laxus notices that nobody has been killed, as he in fact, never thought of any of Fairy Tail as enemies, much to his surprise. Laxus and Natsu finally clash one last time and with help of Gajeel, Natsu is able to defeat Laxus. Fantasia is postponed for 1 day, and an injured Laxus goes to Fairy Tail to have a talk with Makarov, in where he's expelled but remain in good terms. Fantasia is then hosted, just as Makarov and the rest of guild, give a sign to Laxus which was something he came up to Makarov when Laxus was a child.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/114801/2410791.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"幻想曲[ファンタジア]\"},{\"title\":\"The Day of the Fateful Encounter\",\"number\":49,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Harvest Festival is over, and things at the guild have returned to normal... Well, normal for Fairy Tail, that is, since everyone is making a huge fuss over a reporter from the Weekly Sorcerer that`s coming to do a special report!  At the same time, Cana tells Lucy this fortune \\\"My cards tell me that today you will have a fateful encounter.\\\" Is Lucy`s love life going to get a jump start when two young men, the reporter for the magazine and a novelist, show up in front of her? Who could be Lucy`s fated partner!?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"運命の出会いの日\"},{\"title\":\"Special Request: Watch Out for the Guy You Like!\",\"number\":50,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There`s more strange happenings at Fairy Tail! Mira says that Natsu might be in love with Lucy, which causes Lucy`s heart to race... At the same time, Juvia tries to fulfill her tender heart`s painful unrequited love for Gray by using a forbidden magic potion! But could this potion bring Fairy Tail to the brink of destruction?! Everyone`s making a giant fuss over love, but how will it all end?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"特別依頼. 気になる彼に注意せよ!\"},{\"title\":\"Love & Lucky\",\"number\":51,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A suspicious shadow tails close behind Lucy... Why, it`s Lucy`s father, completely changed! His business and all his money were completely taken from him. Lucy ends up turning away her father when he desperately begs for money. But the trade guild that he is heading to in order to start over is attacked! \\\"He may be that man... But even so, I have to save him!\\\" Lucy goes to save the only father she`s got!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"LOVE&LUCKY\"},{\"title\":\"Allied Forces, Assemble!\",\"number\":52,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The most powerful force of the Dark Guilds is the \\\"Baram Alliance\\\"!! It looks like one of the key members, the Dark Guild Oracion Seis, has started making some seriously worrying moves. And to counter it, Fairy Tail is teaming up with three other official guilds to form their own alliance!  All gathered up, the group has a bad-boy, a gigolo, a narcissist, and... a kid?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"連合軍, 集結!\"},{\"title\":\"Enter the Oracion Seis!\",\"number\":53,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oracion Seis is trying to get their hands on a powerful magic sealed away by the ancients called \\\"Nirvana.\\\" And in order to stop them, the allied forces are about to set their plan into action, but they`re already playing into the enemy`s hands! With their guard down, both Jura and Ichiya are out for the count, and even their supposed trump card, the magical bomber, crashes in flames right before Natsu`s eyes! Then, with no hesitation, all of Oracion Seis shows up right in front of everyone! It`s the Allied Forces verses the Six Wizard Generals! Wait, right off the bat?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"六魔将軍[オラシオンセイス]現る!\"},{\"title\":\"Maiden of the Sky\",\"number\":54,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Wendy is actually the Sky Dragon Slayer, and she can use Healing Magic! But she and Happy are taken away by Oracion Seis... Natsu and the rest follow them to get Wendy back, so she can save Erza from the poison she was hit with in the last battle, however Oracion Seis has their own plans to get Wendy to heal \\\"that person who holds the key to Nirvana...\\\" And you`ll never guess who that person is!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天空の巫女\"},{\"title\":\"The Girl and the Ghost\",\"number\":55,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The alliance hurries to rescue the captured Wendy, but a number of Dark Guilds are standing in their way! Somehow Natsu kicks the butts of the powerful foes in his way and reaches the place where Wendy and Happy are, but there he comes face to face with someone he could never have imagined encountering! Before him is Jellal, who was supposed to have been engulfed in Etherion and vanished at the Tower of Heaven! Jellal then leaves on his own... His appearance has turned everything willy-nilly!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"少女と亡霊\"},{\"title\":\"Dead Grand Prix\",\"number\":56,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu is heading back with Wendy, who holds the key to saving Erza, while Gray is facing off against one of the cornerstones of Oracion Seis, Racer! But things go beyond just his overwhelming speed, and heat up into an all-out magic motorcycle race, the Dead Grand Prix! Gray`s got guts taking on the enemy on his own turf, but then his old fellow pupil Lyon shows up. With the two them working in sync, can they find a way to steal his speed?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"デッドGP[グランプリ]\"},{\"title\":\"Darkness\",\"number\":57,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza`s life is saved thanks to Wendy`s Healing Magic! Natsu and the others are overjoyed, but just then, from the center of the Worth Woodsea, a pillar of black light rises up! Could that be Nirvana? Natsu doesn`t waste a single moment and dashes off toward the light. Meanwhile, the member of Oracion Seis known as Midnight is now awake. While the situation gets even more chaotic, the fearsome truth of Nirvana is revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇\"},{\"title\":\"Celestial Skirmish\",\"number\":58,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nirvana... A fearsome magic that switches darkness and light! Lucy and Hibiki, who knows about this, hurry to chase after Natsu and Erza, but one of Oracion Seis, the Celestial Wizard Angel, stands in their way! Lucy can`t stand the way that Angel thinks of her Spirits as nothing more than tools. But before the more powerful Angel, Lucy is brought to her knees! Her back to the wall, facing defeat, Lucy`s feelings for her Spirits call forth something amazing...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"星霊合戦\"},{\"title\":\"Jellal of Days Gone By\",\"number\":59,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"\\\"Jellal is alive...\\\" Knowing the shocking truth, the revived Erza aims straight for Jellal. And then the two meet again... But the Jellal she knew isn`t the one that`s there! This Jellal is changed completely... What could be the reason why he unlocked Nirvana`s seal? And his shocking, heroic determination is...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"追憶のジェラール\"},{\"title\":\"March of Destruction\",\"number\":60,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jellal has cast a self-destruction magic circle on himself! He thought he would be able to destroy Nirvana that way. However, Brain of Oracion Seis suddenly appears, removes the self-destruction magic circle easily... and Nirvana is finally reborn! Nirvana, ruled by wickedness... Soon darkness will rise over the world... But everyone`s hopes are still connected! Natsu and the others refuse to give up, and challenge the darkness of Oracion Seis!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"破滅の行進\"},{\"title\":\"Super Aerial Battle: Natsu vs. Cobra!\",\"number\":61,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nirvana has been activated once again! In order to stop it, Natsu and Happy show up in front of Brain, but one of Oracion Seis, Cobra, stands in their way. Natsu and Happy vs. Cobra and his poison snake Cubellios in a giant mid-air battle! With all his attacks being \\\"heard\\\", nothing Natsu tries seems to work. But the shocking truth about Cobra may lead to the final blow!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"超空中戦! ナツvs. コブラ\"},{\"title\":\"Wizard Saint Jura\",\"number\":62,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nirvana is an ultra inversion magic that switched light and darkness! And for some reason Brain from Oracion Seis is heading toward Wendy`s guild, Caitshelter, trying to destroy it! But standing against the evil Brain is Jura of Lamia Scale, and he`s seriously angry! Can the power of someone bestowed with the title of Wizard Saint defeat Brain and stop Nirvana?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"聖十[せいてん]のジュラ\"},{\"title\":\"Your Words\",\"number\":63,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza and Jellal take on the final member of Oracion Seis, Midnight! But he`s so powerful he even defeats Jellal easily! Erza suffers under Midnight`s \\\"Reflector\\\" magic that is capable of bending and warping anything... Facing the most powerful member of Oracion Seis, can they find any chance for victory?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"君の言葉こそ\"},{\"title\":\"Zero\",\"number\":64,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oracion Seis has been wiped out! Natsu and the Alliance have, after a fierce struggle, come out victorious... But, could it just be the beginning of an even greater life and death battle? Incredibly, when all six of Oracion Seis fall, they release the Body Link magic cast on Brain that seals away his alternate personality, the guild master of Oracion Seis, Zero! Zero loves destruction, and holds immense, evil magic power... With Caitshelter in sight, Natsu and the gang do battle with the most powerful foe they`ve ever faced!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゼロ\"},{\"title\":\"From Pegasus to Fairies\",\"number\":65,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nirvana fired on Caitshelter! But, in the nick of time, Hibiki and the others appear in the magical bomber Christina, and block the attack.  And furthermore, they know the way that Nirvana can be stopped!  Hibiki tells everyone that the way to stop Nirvana is to destroy the lacrima in each of the six legs simultaneously. Everyone is covered in battle wounds, but they still haven`t given up hope! Can Natsu and the gang stop Zero`s evil ambitions?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天馬から妖精たちへ\"},{\"title\":\"The Power of Feelings\",\"number\":66,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Alliance heads out to stop Nirvana, even though they are bruised and battered to the point of barely being able to stand...  Natsu uses his nose to pick the lacrima where the strongest enemy awaits him, Master Zero! Zero and Natsu are both rarin` for a fight, but Natsu has reached the limits of his magic power, and he`s in serious trouble. But then Jellal shows up, even though he should have headed to a different lacrima, and attacks Natsu with magic. Has Jellal fallen to the darkness yet again? What will Natsu do when his back`s against the wall?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"想いの力\"},{\"title\":\"I`m with You\",\"number\":67,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, with his true Dragon Slayer`s powers unleashed, finally crushes the lacrima and Master Zero! The rest of the lacrima are destroyed by his partners, and Nirvana thunderously crashes to the ground! With their victory secured, the alliance picks themselves back up. But, someone has set up runes, trapping Natsu and the others! The identity of the person who imprisoned them is the Captain of the Reformed Magic Council`s 4th Enforcement and Detention Corps. What does he want, after appearing out of the blue?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"私がついている\"},{\"title\":\"A Guild for One\",\"number\":68,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Even if you lose your memories, that does not absolve your sins... The aim of the Reformed Magic Council wasn`t just Oracion Seis, but to capture Jellal! Seeing Erza`s expression as she grapples with that reality, the rest of Fairy Tail springs into action to stop his arrest. What is Erza`s answer, as she watches over it all? \\nThen, Wendy and the others return to the guild Caitshelter, where Master Robaul tells them the shocking truth. What is Caitshelter`s big secret?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"たった一人の為のギルド\"},{\"title\":\"Call of the Dragon\",\"number\":69,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and the others have returned to Fairy Tail after their long mission. The friendly, familial atmosphere heals all their fatigue from the fierce battles they had. Wendy and Carla join up, and the entire guild is in high spirits!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"竜の誘い\"},{\"title\":\"Natsu vs. Gray!!\",\"number\":70,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and the others came to the traveler`s inn Rise after getting info from Gray, but what was awaiting them there was a trap by Daphne, and now they can`t get out of the inn! And why did Gray...?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツvs.グレイ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Friendship Overcomes the Dead\",\"number\":71,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Daphne`s goal was to capture Natsu, and use him to power her the artificial dragon she created through long years of research, the Dragonoid! The Dragonoid sucks out Natsu`s Dragon Slayer magic, but then...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"友は屍[しかばね]を越えて\"},{\"title\":\"A Fairy Tail Wizard\",\"number\":72,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza and the others hear Natsu cry out \\\"Bust this thing up, and me along with it!\\\" At the same time, the master hears the truth from Gray. Will Natsu`s power all be sucked into the Dragonoid?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"フェアリーテイルの魔導士\"},{\"title\":\"Rainbow Cherry Blossoms\",\"number\":73,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lucy is all excited for the big event that only comes once a year, the Fairy Tail hanami party! But before that she heads up Mt. Hakobe with Natsu and the gang for what she thought would be an easy request...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"虹[にじ]のさくら\"},{\"title\":\"Wendy`s First Big Job!?\",\"number\":74,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Wendy`s gotten used to doing jobs at Fairy Tail and wants to try taking on something bigger so she can be more help to everyone, but gets into an argument with Carla over it.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウェンディ, 初めての大仕事!?\"},{\"title\":\"24-Hour Endurance Road Race\",\"number\":75,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Once a year, the master holds a mandatory 24-hour long road race for all the members of Fairy Tail. Jet seems to be a shoe-in to take the victory again this year, but the real competition is making sure not to come in last, because that wizard must face an unspeakable punishment from the master himself! For this day only, the Fairy Tail Wizards aren`t allies, but bitter rivals!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"24時間耐久ロードレース\"},{\"title\":\"Gildarts\",\"number\":76,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fairy Tail is going along without trouble, when all of a sudden an alarm rings out, and Natsu and the rest erupt in jubilation! Yes, Fairy Tail`s strongest wizard, Gildarts, has returned!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ギルダーツ\"},{\"title\":\"Earth Land\",\"number\":77,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Gajeel searching for his own cat and Natsu sound asleep, Fairy Tail is unusually peaceful. Why then is Carla the only one that seems apprehensive? Does she know something that the others don`t?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アースランド\"},{\"title\":\"Edolas\",\"number\":78,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and Happy, along with Wendy and Carla, are the only ones left after Fairy Tail, guild and all, is sucked into an alternate world named Edolas! What`s more, Carla seems to know something about what happened...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エドラス\"},{\"title\":\"Fairy Hunter\",\"number\":79,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Edolas... It`s almost like a parallel world! A different world with a different culture and history from Earthland... And in it exists a completely \\\"different\\\" Fairy Tail?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"妖精狩り\"},{\"title\":\"Key of Hope\",\"number\":80,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and Wendy have come to Edolas to rescue their friends who have been absorbed for their magic power! But traveling in Edolas, a land where magic can`t be used freely, Natsu quickly attracts trouble...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"希望の鍵\"},{\"title\":\"Fireball\",\"number\":81,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Who appears before Natsu and the gang, but none other than Earthland Lucy! Sent to Edolas by Mystogan, she can somehow still use her magic, and successfully drives away the Royal Army forces!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ファイアボール\"},{\"title\":\"Welcome Home\",\"number\":82,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Our heroes reach the Royal City, where Edolas`s dictator King Faust reveals his evil plans for the lacrima that was once all the people of Magnolia! Natsu and Lucy can barely hold back their anger, but is there some way to approach the castle without being caught by the army?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おかえりなさいませ\"},{\"title\":\"Extalia\",\"number\":83,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and Wendy are thrown in jail, while Lucy is taken to be executed! Meanwhile, Happy and Carla find themselves in Extalia, the kingdom of the Exceeds... But to their shock, Extalia is a land filled with cats like them! Heralded as heroes for completing their duty, Happy and Carla are escorted to the Queen, but what exactly was their duty to begin with anyway? The shocking truth is...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エクスタリア\"},{\"title\":\"Fly, to Our Friends!\",\"number\":84,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Happy and Carla run from their fate, and Happy declares \\\"We`re going to save our friends!\\\" When the two are chased, the Exceed couple which gives them shelter is...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"飛べ! 友のもとに!\"},{\"title\":\"Code ETD\",\"number\":85,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Happy and Carla have learned the truth about their origins and realized that they, Exceeds, are the only creatures in Edolas that have magic power within their bodies! Meanwhile, the Queen has ordered Lucy to be executed, and the evil Byron has sinister plans for the two Dragon Slayers, Natsu and Wendy. Will they make it in time?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"コードETD\"},{\"title\":\"Erza vs. Erza\",\"number\":86,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Just in time, who appears before the captured Lucy? Gray and Erza! Gajeel`s Dragon Slayer Magic somehow resurrected them from the giant lacrima! But then, an epic battle breaks out between the two Erzas. Meanwhile, King Faust has a truly sinister plan for the magic power he extracted from Natsu and Wendy...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エルザ vs. エルザ\"},{\"title\":\"We`re Talking About Lives Here!!!!\",\"number\":87,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Lucy, and Gray hurry to strike down Edolas`s King Faust before he can execute Code ETD! But standing in their way are the Royal Army`s Hughes and Sugar Boy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"命だろーか!!!!\"},{\"title\":\"For Pride`s Sake, the River of Stars\",\"number\":88,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It`s Lucy vs. Bydo and Gray vs. Sugar Boy in a mad dash for the key to the Dragon Chain Cannon! Edolas plans to use it to ram the lacrima into Extalia, so the Fairy Tail gang goes all out to make sure that key never falls back into King Faust`s hands!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"星の大河は誇りの為に\"},{\"title\":\"The Apocalyptic Dragon Chain Cannon\",\"number\":89,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"ith Sugar Boy, Bydo, and Hughes all defeated, Gray and Natsu try to figure out a way to get to the Dragon Chain Cannon and use it to save everyone, instead of using it to ram the lacrima into Extalia like King Faust intends. But the room is sealed with an anti-wizard barrier, and time is running out! Just then, Erza appears, but is it the Erza that brings hope, or despair?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"終焉の竜鎖砲\"},{\"title\":\"The Boy Back Then\",\"number\":90,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Dragon Chain Cannon has been fired, and the floating island with the giant lacrima is hurtling toward Extalia! Can Natsu and the others stop it in time? Back on Extalia, the Queen is notified of the incoming threat... Will the Queen, said to have the power of God, finally show her hand to strike down the rebelling humans?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"あの時の少年\"},{\"title\":\"Dragon Sense\",\"number\":91,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Extalia might be saved, and the giant lacrima sent back to Earthland, but trouble isn`t over yet for Edolas, because Erza Knightwalker and her Legion squadron of the Royal Army are here to spoil everyone`s celebration!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"DRAGON SENSE\"},{\"title\":\"O Living Ones\",\"number\":92,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lucy, Gray, Happy and Carla are surrounded by the Legion Regiment of the Royal Army, while Natsu, Wendy, and Gajeel are facing a forbidden super weapon that repels all magic, piloted by King Faust himself, and Erza has her final showdown with Erza Knightwalker... Exhausted, outnumbered, and on unfamiliar turf, the Fairy Tail wizards have it tough... Is there anyone in Edolas willing to fight for the future of their own country? And what is the prince of Edolas, Mystogan, doing in the Anima Control Room?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生きる者たちよ\"},{\"title\":\"I`m Standing Right Here\",\"number\":93,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the Royal Army being beating back by Edolas`s Fairy Tail, and Edolas Erza out of action, it`s up to the Dragon Slayers to take out Droma Anim, King Faust`s ultimate magic weapon... But it just keeps sucking up more magic power and getting stronger! Can the Dragon Slayers work together and win? Meanwhile, Prince Jellal starts a giant Anima in reverse, sucking all magic power out of Edolas and into Earthland! Did he save the world only to destroy it?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オレはここに立っている\"},{\"title\":\"Bye-Bye Edolas\",\"number\":94,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mystogan, or Prince Jellal as the people from Edolas know him, has set Anima in reverse and all the magic power of Edolas is being sucked into Earthland! But Panther Lily can`t bring himself to go along with Jellal`s plan to sacrifice himself to make Lily as the new king... However the only way to calm the people is to set up a battle between a villain and a hero... Suddenly, a trio of evil-doers shows up wrecking havoc in the city, claiming to have stolen away Edolas`s magic power.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"バイバイ エドラス\"},{\"title\":\"Lisanna\",\"number\":95,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Fairy Tail gang is back safe in Earthland, but they`ve got a whole flock of flying cats as a souvenir! Carla still hasn`t forgiven them for the brainwashing and kill the Dragon Slayers mission they gave her, but perhaps there`s more to it than meets the eye?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"リサーナ\"},{\"title\":\"He Who Extinguishes Life\",\"number\":96,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lead In: Natsu and company return to see the guild as lively as ever, with everyone celebrating Lisanna`s return. Meanwhile, in Edolas, Mystogan makes the first steps to rebuilding the kingdom and healing the wounds of the past...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生命[いのち]を消す者\"},{\"title\":\"Best Partners\",\"number\":97,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Things are back to normal around Fairy Tail and everyone is busy going about doing jobs... or actually, some people are working harder than ever before! The Master has some kind of big announcement to make and Lucy`s really curious what all the hubbub is about... It`s time for the once a year, S Class Wizard Advancement Exam! But who will the Master pick to be eligible to participate, and who will they pick as their partners?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ベストパートナー\"},{\"title\":\"Who`s the Lucky One?\",\"number\":98,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Eight wizard duos travel to an island rich with magic - but only one wizard will be given S-Class ranking.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"運がいいのは誰?\"},{\"title\":\"Natsu Vs. Gildarts\",\"number\":99,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In a tunnel below Tenroujima, Natsu runs into Gildarts, the strongest wizard in Fairy Tail. Gildarts aims to teach Natsu a lesson he`ll never forget, even if it means failing Natsu at the S Class Wizard Advancement Exam...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツ vs. ギルダーツ\"},{\"title\":\"Mest\",\"number\":100,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The teams arrive on Tenroujima and the first test of the S Class Wizard Advancement Exam begins! There are 8 paths to choose from, and luck determines just who breezes through and who has to face Erza, Gildarts, or Mirajane!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"メスト\"},{\"title\":\"Black Wizard\",\"number\":101,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The guild comes across a strange person in the forest who has a deadly magic power and seems to recognize Natsu. Meanwhile, the strongest of the dark guilds - Grimoire Heart - approaches the island, and they`ve got plans for the mysterious wizard.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黒魔導士\"},{\"title\":\"Iron Soul\",\"number\":102,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Advanced forces from Grimoire Heart have shown up on Tenroujima, Fairy Tail`s holy grounds! Running into Levy and Gajeel would seem like bad luck, but these lackeys are a cut above! It`s an all out guild war, and this time Gajeel is on Fairy Tail`s side!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鉄の魂\"},{\"title\":\"Makarov Charges\",\"number\":103,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Grimoire Heart closing in, Master Makarov makes a stand.  Meanwhile, Mest isn`t the only intruder on the island, as one of the Seven Kin of Purgatory, Azuma, shows up with a bang! The war has only begun...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"進撃のマカロフ\"},{\"title\":\"Lost Magic\",\"number\":104,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fairy Tail deals with Grimoire Heart`s grunts, while Makarov confronts his old master, Purehitol, now known as Hades.  Will this be Makarov`s last stand?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"失われた魔法[ロストマジック]\"},{\"title\":\"Fire Dragon vs. Flame God\",\"number\":105,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu faces off against Zancrow, one of Master Hade`s specially trained Wizards, the 7 Kin of Purgatory! Zancrow proclaims himself to be a God Slayer, with control of flames that even Natsu can`t eat! Meanwhile, the rest of Fairy Tail is scattered and facing their own challengers. Is there any way for Natsu to win?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火竜 vs. 炎神\"},{\"title\":\"Grand Magic World\",\"number\":106,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mirajane faces off against Azuma, but does she have the strength to win anymore? Meanwhile, Ultear closes in on Zeref, and Grimoire Heart`s true objective is revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大魔法世界\"},{\"title\":\"Arc of Embodiment\",\"number\":107,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Elfman and Evergreen still have trouble with their teamwork, but they somehow manage to work together to get the upper hand on Rustyrose. But just when they think they have him cornered, he keeps putting out some other crazy magic! How can they fight against someone who has the ability to turn anything he says into reality?! Meanwhile, Loke realizes the true nature of Caprico, and challenges him to a one-on-one battle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"具現のアーク\"},{\"title\":\"Human Gate\",\"number\":108,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Caprico and Loke face off, Spirit against Spirit! But with Caprico`s control over Human Gates, can Loke win? Meanwhile, Natsu faces off with Ultear, and Erza and Juvia mix it up with Meldy while the rest of Fairy Tail regroups...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"人間の扉\"},{\"title\":\"Lucy Fire\",\"number\":109,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lucy`s been knocked out by Cana, and wakes up to a big surprise! Kain Hikaru, one of the 7 Kin of Purgatory, is going to use his creepy voodoo magic to stomp her flat! But turnabout is fair play, in love and magic!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルーシィファイア\"},{\"title\":\"Dead-End of Despair\",\"number\":110,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fairy Tail regroups a little, while Grimoire Hearts debates sending in their greatest warrior... Meanwhile, Erza and Juvia face off against Meldy, whose Maguilty Sense Lost Magic uses her own opponent`s emotions against them! Will Juvia`s love for Gray give her the strength to win, or lead her to defeat?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶望の袋小路\"},{\"title\":\"Tears of Love and Vitality\",\"number\":111,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Juvia and Meldy`s senses have been linked with Gray`s! Now, no matter which one of them is killed, Gray will die as well! Is there a way to escape from this love-hate triangle of death? Meanwhile, the second in command of Grimoire Heart joins the battle, making a grave situation even more weighty!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"愛と活力の涙\"},{\"title\":\"The One Thing I Couldn`t Say\",\"number\":112,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and the others do battle with Bluenote, but they are no match for his powers over gravity. Meanwhile, Cana discovers Mavis`s grave, and the true reason for her striving so hard to become an S class wizard is revealed! But will it matter if everyone is crushed by Bluenote?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"言えなかった一言\"},{\"title\":\"Tenrou Tree\",\"number\":113,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gildarts and Bluenote square off, while Erza and Azuma face each other at the roots of the Tenrou Tree. But time is running out for Fairy Tail, as Master Hades had a trump card in his pocket the whole time! The battle of Tenroujima ventures into its final stages!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天狼樹\"},{\"title\":\"Erza vs. Azuma\",\"number\":114,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Azuma has felled the giant Tenrou Tree, and is stealing the magic power from all the Fairy Tail wizards on the island! He challenges Erza to a one-on-one duel, with the lives of all her fellow guild members hanging in the balance. Can Erza muster the power to protect her friends? Or does true strength come from something else?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エルザvs.アズマ\"},{\"title\":\"Freezing Fighting Spirit\",\"number\":115,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Azuma defeated, all the Fairy Tail wizards get their magic power back! It`s comeback time on Tenroujima, and Gildarts, Fried, and Bickslow are going to show the remaining fighters from Grimoire Heart how stubborn Fairy Tail can be! Meanwhile, Ultear tells Gray the truth behind her actions, and begs him to defeat Hades and fulfill her mother`s dream...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"凍える闘志\"},{\"title\":\"Power of Life\",\"number\":116,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It`s Ul`s pupil vs. Ul`s daughter! What is Ultear really after and why has she turned against her own flesh and blood? The final battle with the leader of the 7 Kin of Purgatory comes to its thrilling conclusion!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生なる力\"},{\"title\":\"Rolling Thunder\",\"number\":117,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Juvia chases Meredy as she carries Zeref before they run into Zancrow, who takes Zeref and cruelly reveals to Meredy that Ultear was responsible for destroying her home. Suddenly, Zeref awakens, utters the name \\\"Acnologia\\\", and unleashes a deadly wave of magic that kills Zancrow and knocks out Juvia and Meredy. Overhearing the commotion, Dranbalt warns the rest of the Magic Council troops, who retreat from the island. Meanwhile, Natsu, Lucy, Wendy, Happy, Carla, and Lily regroup with Gray and Erza. The exceeds infiltrate the Grimoire Heart airship to destroy its power source while the others take on Hades directly. Despite them fighting at full strength, Hades is unfazed by their attacks and prepares to kill Natsu, but is stopped by the timely arrival of Laxus.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雷鳴響く\"},{\"title\":\"The Man Without an Emblem\",\"number\":118,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Laxus furiously battles Hades to avenge Makarov. Their fight rages until Hades gravely injures Laxus, so he transfers his own lightning magic to Natsu and tells him to defeat Hades. Meanwhile, the rest of the uninjured Fairy Tail members defend their wounded master and friends from Kain Hikaru, Kawazu, and Yomazu.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"紋章を刻まぬ男\"},{\"title\":\"Realm of the Abyss\",\"number\":119,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Despite using Laxus`s lightning power to its fullest, Natsu`s attacks continue to have no effect on Hades. Rather, Hades awakens the true depths of his magic power before the powerless Fairy Tail wizards, immobilizing them with fear. However, Natsu bolsters his friends with the same words of courage Gildarts had given them during the exam, and leads them in one final assault against Hades. Meanwhile, Happy, Charle, and Panther Lily stumble across a mechanical heart on the ship and try to destroy it.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"深淵の領域\"},{\"title\":\"Daybreak on Tenrou Island\",\"number\":120,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The mechanical heart Happy and Charl destroy turns out to be giving Hades his power. Ultear uses her magic to return the Tenrou Tree to its original state, allowing Natsu, Lucy, Gray, Erza, Wendy, and Laxus to finally defeat the now powerless Hades. Makarov and the other injured guildmates return and order Grimoire Heart to leave Tenrou Island. As the Fairy Tail wizards celebrate and recover from their fight, Hades and the other defeated Grimoire Heart members discover Zeref on their ship.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"暁の天狼島\"},{\"title\":\"The Right to Love\",\"number\":121,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zeref reveals to Hades that his power had never been sealed to begin with, making Grimoire Heart`s efforts to reawaken him pointless. Accusing Hades of summoning the dragon called Acnologia through his guild`s actions, Zeref kills him. Ultear, meanwhile, confesses to Meredy about destroying her hometown and tries to drown herself out of guilt, but Meredy rescues and forgives her. On Tenrou Island, Makarov postpones the S-Class exam because of the battle, and Cana finally tells Gildarts that she is his daughter. As this happens, Acnologia forebodingly flies towards Tenrou Island as Zeref watches in alarm.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"愛する資格\"},{\"title\":\"Let`s Hold Hands\",\"number\":122,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Acnologia appears on Tenrou Island and begins destroying everything in sight. Makarov tries to hold Acnologia off for his guild to escape, but they refuse to let their master die and help him fight the dragon. Everyone holds hands with one another to try and cast a defensive spell against Acnologia`s breath attack, which seemingly obliterates the island. Seven years pass with the Fairy Tail members on the island missing and presumed dead.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"手をつなごう\"},{\"title\":\"Fairy Tail, Year X791\",\"number\":123,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With their strongest members gone for seven years, the Fairy Tail guild has become the weakest wizards` guild in Fiore, indebted to and bullied by Twilight Ogre, a new local guild. The remaining Fairy Tail members are visited by Ichiya and the Tri-men of Blue Pegasus, who tell them that they have recently discovered a change in the magical energy around the waters where Tenrou Island once stood. There they discover that the island was protected against Acnologia`s attack by the spirit of Mavis Vermilion, who used her power to help everyone on the island cast the defensive Fairy Sphere spell that inadvertently caused them to be frozen in time for seven years. The missing members return to their guild, drive the members of Twilight Ogre away, and reunite with their friends and Romeo is finally smiling after seeing Natsu, Lucy and the others again.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"X791年・妖精の尻尾[フェアリーテイル]\"},{\"title\":\"The Seven Year Gap\",\"number\":124,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The members of Lamia Scale visit Fairy Tail as they celebrate their friends` return. Gray learns from Lyon what had happened to Ultear and Meredy over the past seven years, while Erza learns the same about Jellal. Makarov, Erza, and Mirajane later visit the Twilight Ogre guild and take revenge for being bullied by them. Meanwhile, Lucy is kicked out of her house for being unable to pay her rent for seven years. She decides to visit her father Jude, only to learn he had died one month before she and her friends returned from Tenrou Island. She is allowed to return to her house by her landlady, who reveals to her seven years worth of birthday presents and rent money from her father, who had also left a letter detailing his unwavering hope that she was alive. Realizing her father truly loved her, Lucy admits her own love for her father.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"空白の7年\"},{\"title\":\"The Magic Ball\",\"number\":125,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Lucy, and their friends take a job to capture Velveno, an escaped convict with the power to transform into other people and mimic their magic, who plans to attend a ball held by the wealthy Count Balsamico for his daughter Aceto to find a husband. It is assumed by the count that Velveno is there to steal the valuable Balsamico family ring. The Fairy Tail members fail to capture him before he obtains the ring, but he instead uses it to propose to Aceto as he is in love with her. Aceto accepts his proposal on the condition that he turn himself in for his crimes, which he does, though it costs Fairy Tail their reward for the job.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魔法舞踏会\"},{\"title\":\"True Scoundrels: The Butt Jiggle Gang\",\"number\":126,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu, Lucy, and Wendy keep watch over a gold-carrying train, which is hijacked by a trio of large-buttocked thieves called the Jiggle Butt Gang. The three use Natsu`s motion sickness to their advantage to get rid of Lucy, Happy, and Carla, leaving Wendy the only one able to defend the train`s cargo. She manages to impress them with her powers and tries to talk them out of their thieving ways, but once the train stops and Natsu recovers, Natsu sends them flying before she has a chance.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"真の悪ケツプリ団\"},{\"title\":\"The Terror of Invisible Lucy!\",\"number\":127,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lucy bathes with a magical lotion she created seven years ago, only to find that its effects have changed over the years to turn her entire body invisible. She turns to her friends for help, but their attempts to make her visible again by painting on her and masking her fail. Eventually the lotion`s effects become so severe that they cause Lucy to disappear together with everyone`s memories of her as if she had never existed. Fortunately, Natsu is able to remember his friendship with Lucy, allowing everyone to recall her back into existence. As Happy hugs Lucy in joy, however, she accidentally spills the lotion bottle over everyone else, turning all of them invisible.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"透明ルーシィの恐怖!\"},{\"title\":\"Father`s Memento\",\"number\":128,\"airDate\":\"2012-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Michelle, a girl claiming to be Lucy`s relative, visits Fairy Tail and gives Lucy a briefcase containing a large metallic rod, which she says is a memento from Lucy`s late father. Because Michelle is an orphan and has nowhere else to go, Lucy takes Michelle in and suggests she start working at Fairy Tail. While adjusting to life at the guild, Michelle suggests that Lucy send a request to investigate the key. After Michelle accidentally drops the rod, it levitates into the air and a set of glowing symbols appears upon it. Makarov becomes suspicious and warns Lucy not to involve herself with the rod any further, though Lucy remains determined to find out what her father asked of her.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"父の遺品\"},{\"title\":\"Turbulent Showdown! Natsu vs. Laxus\",\"number\":129,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and Gajeel challenge the still-exiled Laxus to a fight. Wendy suggests they have a showdown the next day in the hopes that they will calm down and lose interest, but it only excites the rest of the guild, who hold a festival for it. Almost as soon as their battle starts, however, Laxus beats Natsu with a single punch and Gajeel runs away in fear. While the rest of the town searches for Gajeel, the guild is visited by three figures resembling Hughes, Sugar Boy, and Coco from Edolas. Meanwhile, Lucy decodes the writing on the rod with Levy`s help and discovers that it is the hand of a legendary clock.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒涛の対決! ナツvs.ラクサス\"},{\"title\":\"Target: Lucy\",\"number\":130,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The three visiting wizards, who turn out to be the Earthland counterparts of Hughes (a woman named Mary Hughes), Sugar Boy, and Coco, battle Fairy Tail and demand to hand Lucy over to them. Michelle passes herself off as Lucy to protect her, prompting the rest of the guild to confuse the three into thinking that all of the females at Fairy Tail are Lucy so she and Michelle can escape. However, Hughes chases the two and forces them off the edge of a cliff.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"狙われたルーシィ\"},{\"title\":\"The Fury of Legion\",\"number\":131,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It`s Natsu versus Sugar Boy! Wendy and Lily versus Coco! Lucy versus Hughes! And Gildarts versus Byro! But are the members of Legion really after Lucy... or something else?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"レギオンの猛威\"},{\"title\":\"Key of the Starry Heavens\",\"number\":132,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Legion makes off with Lucy`s key, the only thing the members of Fairy Tail can do is search for clues to figure out Legion`s objective and the purpose of the memento from Lucy`s father. They head to Lucy`s old family mansion, but as soon as they discover a hint, two more Legionnaires crash the party... and one of them is an Exceed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"星空の鍵\"},{\"title\":\"Travel Companions\",\"number\":133,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It`s a race against time as the members of Fairy Tail split up into groups to find the scattered pieces of the mystical clock before Legion, but they run into all manner of obstacles. Nor does it help that Natsu is currently a doll-sized version of himself!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"旅の仲間たち\"},{\"title\":\"Labyrinth Capriccio\",\"number\":134,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu and Lucy`s team explore the ancient ruins of the Sacred Graveyard, going ever downward as they get through each floor`s challenge. Meanwhile, in an interdimensional space, Gray, Juvia, and Lyon are in a desperate battle with Sugar Boy over the first piece of the mysterious clock!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"迷宮狂想曲\"},{\"title\":\"Footprints of the Myth\",\"number\":135,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Fairy Tail teams get ever closer to the clock parts, but two Legion members have already shown up to challenge Natsu`s team! And that means more size-changing shenanigans, deathtraps, and unlikely allies than you can throw a stick at!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"神話の足跡\"},{\"title\":\"True Scoundrels, Once Again\",\"number\":136,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"They`re back by no one`s demand! The Jiggle Butt Gang is committing more fragrant fouls (or is that \\\"foul fragrances\\\") than ever before, which stinks because they`re doing it right in the faces of Erza and Wendy! Meanwhile, the only thing that can possibly break up the brawl between Natsu and Dan... is Lucy?! Oh, and... clock parts are finally discovered!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"真の悪, ふたたび\"},{\"title\":\"Defying Calculation\",\"number\":137,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Fairy Tail teams have located the scattered clock parts, but keeping them out of the hands of Legion is another thing entirely! Dan Straight chases Lucy around in one location while Panther Lily and Samuel have an Exceed-ingly ferocious battle in another. Meanwhile, Gajeel and Shadow Gear contend with a giant stone guardian below.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"計算をこえるもの\"},{\"title\":\"The Course of the Holy War\",\"number\":138,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mary Hughes breaks a taboo by unleashing her ultimate power! Can Mirajane out-ultimate her? Plus, Natsu takes on a giant octopus! And... the debut of the Jiggle Jugs Gang?! (Warning: It`s not as appealing as it sounds...)\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"聖戦のゆくえ\"},{\"title\":\"Time Begins to Tick\",\"number\":139,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu gives all he`s got against a Legion of one: Byro Cracy, who has the power to nullify all magic! Will the other Fairy Tail groups get there in time to pitch in? Or will this be... the beginning of the end?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き始めた刻\"},{\"title\":\"Enter the Neo-Oracion Seis!\",\"number\":140,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Just when it looks Fairy Tail is about to have a climactic fight with Byro over the Infinity Clock, Oracion Seis returns, with upgraded powers and a desire to make the ominous clock their own!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新生六魔将軍[オラシオンセイス]現る!\"},{\"title\":\"Get the Infinity Clock!\",\"number\":141,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oracion Seis has made off with the Infinity Clock and seems intent on counting down to doomsday. Meanwhile, Fairy Tail regroups, using Cana`s divination skills to locate Oracion Seis`s targets and choose the best teams to go after them!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"無限時計[むげんどけい]を追え!\"},{\"title\":\"Dissonance of Battle\",\"number\":142,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Doranbolt... or is that Mest Gryder?... returns! But whose side is he on this time? Meanwhile, teamwork isn`t working out for Natsu, Elfman, and Lucy against the threat of Jackpot! Likewise, new partners Erza and Evergreen just can`t get along!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦いの不協和音\"},{\"title\":\"Anti-Link\",\"number\":143,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mest and Lahar meet the mystery person that Zentopia has been hiding... or is that hunting down? Gray and Fried face off against one of the Six Generals (and Dan Straight`s new object of adoration), Angel! Meanwhile, Erza, Evergreen, and Max are confounded by Cobra, master of sound!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アンチリンク\"},{\"title\":\"Despair Unleashed\",\"number\":144,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Oracion Seis`s true plan comes to light! Michelle Lobster isn`t who she seems to be! And for that matter, neither is Jackpot!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"解き放たれた絶望\"},{\"title\":\"Real Nightmare\",\"number\":145,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Natsu is imprisoned inside the Zentopia stronghold... along with the Jiggle Butt Gang! Back home, the Fairy Tail wizards are visited by a few members of the Archaeological Society, who shed some light on the Infinity Clock and what it does. Finally, Oracion Seis has Lucy and are going to use her as the final element to activate \\\"Real Nightmare\\\"!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"リアルナイトメア\"},{\"title\":\"Time Spiral\",\"number\":146,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Cardinal Rapowant`s devious plans begin coming to fruition as time itself warps, affecting even the Fairy Tail members aboard Ichiya`s Christina. En route to rescue Natsu and Lucy, they become children, elderly, and even different species!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"時のスパイラル\"},{\"title\":\"To the Infinity Castle!\",\"number\":147,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Natsu and other Fairy Tail members race to save Lucy before she`s sacrificed by the new Oracion Seis, Gildarts has a non-magic showdown with Byro. They also learn the secret of Cardinal Rapowant, that even he didn`t know!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"無限城へ!\"},{\"title\":\"Angel Tears\",\"number\":148,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In order to save Lucy, the last four members of the new Oracion Seis must be defeated! And one of them is Angel, whose powers seem more demonic than anything as she summons fearsome angels to destroy Gray. When the lovestruck Dan Straight intervenes, will he be a help or hindrance, and to whom?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天使の涙\"},{\"title\":\"I Hear the Voice of My Friend\",\"number\":149,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle to rescue Lucy from the Infinity Clock rages on, but it may be too late as Lucy becomes one with the clock! Plus, the climactic battle between Erza and Cobra!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"友の声が聴こえる\"},{\"title\":\"Lucy and Michelle\",\"number\":150,\"airDate\":\"2012-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Only Brain II is left standing between Natsu and Lucy, but he`s the most powerful of the Six Generals! Also, learn the secret history of Lucy and Michelle in this epic finale to the Key of the Starry Heavens arc!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルーシィとミッシェル\"},{\"title\":\"Sabertooth\",\"number\":151,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Legion pays Fairy Tail a special visit! Fairy Tail learns of Sabertooth, the number one guild in Fiore! And what lies beneath the original Fairy Tail base of operations?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"剣咬の虎[セイバートゥース]\"},{\"title\":\"And So We Aim for the Top\",\"number\":152,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Natsu and some others from the \\\"Tenrou group\\\" visit apothecary hermit Poluchka to see if they can get some medicine to become stronger, Wendy senses something extremely familiar about the misanthropic old woman. Also, the next master of Fairy Tail is chosen (for real) and another important decision is made that could elevate the guild`s dismal reputation!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"そしてオレたちは頂上を目指す\"},{\"title\":\"Song of the Stars\",\"number\":153,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fairy Tail`s best is back, but to rock the Grand Magic Games, they`ve got to make up seven years worth of time in only 3 months! It`s time for some seriously hard training! But before that, a little party in the Spirit World can`t hurt, right?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"星々の歌\"},{\"title\":\"For All the Time We Missed Each Other\",\"number\":154,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There are only five days left `til the Grand Magic Games begin, but Natsu and company still aren`t ready for it. But then they meet up with Crime Sorciere, a small, independent guild led by an old frenemy. The members of this newish guild promise to help Fairy Tail \\\"power up\\\" in exchange for a favor...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"すれ違った時間の分だけ\"},{\"title\":\"Crocus, the Flower-Blooming Capital\",\"number\":155,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Five members of Fairy Tail are selected to participate in the Grand Magic Games. They make their way to Crocus, the capital of Fiore, where their rivals are gathering, too. As pre-Games tensions abound, Erza has a sneaking suspicion about the whole setup...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"花咲く都・クロッカス\"},{\"title\":\"Sky Labyrinth\",\"number\":156,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the elimination round, Natsu and the others have to make their way through the Sky Labyrinth, a giant mind-bending maze full of rotating walls and vicious rivals!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"空中迷宮[スカイラビリンス]\"},{\"title\":\"New Guild\",\"number\":157,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The eight participating guilds of the Grand Magic Games are introduced! Along with Fairy Tail, there are old friends and rivals, old and new enemies... and at least one team that`s completely unexpected!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新規ギルド\"},{\"title\":\"Night of Shooting Stars\",\"number\":158,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It`s \\\"Hidden\\\", the opening game of the Grand Magic Games, and Gray finds that it`s like playing cat and mouse. Unfortunately, he`s the \\\"mouse\\\" as he keeps getting picked off by a member of Raven Tail!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"星降ル夜ニ\"},{\"title\":\"Lucy vs. Flare\",\"number\":159,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the first battle of the first day of the Magic Games, Lucy is pitted against Raven Tail`s Flare, whose long locks are deadly. But when Flare doesn`t play fair, Lucy is forced to grin and bear it or risk a friend getting hurt!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルーシィvs.フレア\"},{\"title\":\"Portent\",\"number\":160,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There are more one-on-one battles on the first day of the Grand Magic Games, culminating with the mysterious \\\"Mystogan\\\" versus Jura! Will a Fairy Tail team finally get points?! Or will Mystogan`s real identity be revealed, blowing his secret mission?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"凶瑞\"},{\"title\":\"Chariots\",\"number\":161,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The second day begins with a chariot race of a sort, obviously not the best event for Natsu as his motion sickness kicks in right away! Surprisingly, though, he`s not alone as two more participants suffer from the same affliction!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦車[チャリオット]\"},{\"title\":\"Elfman vs. Bacchus\",\"number\":162,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the ring, Elfman is forced to face Bacchus, a \\\"drunken fighter\\\" considered to be Erza`s equal! Meanwhile, Natsu wakes up in the infirmary to discover that Wendy and Carla have been kidnapped!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エルフマンvs.バッカス\"},{\"title\":\"Mirajane vs. Jenny\",\"number\":163,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The second day of the Grand Magic Games continues, with Mirajane of Fairy Tail Team B fighting against Jenny Realight of Team Blue Pegasus.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ミラジェーンvs.ジェニー\"},{\"title\":\"Kagura vs. Yukino\",\"number\":164,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yukino is revealed to be a Celestial Spirit wizard when she summons Libra and Pisces to attack Kagura.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カグラvs.ユキノ\"},{\"title\":\"Hatred at Nightfall\",\"number\":165,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Yukino is expelled from Sabertooth, she offers to relinquish her two Golden Gatekeys to Lucy to complete the latter`s collection of the Zodiac Gatekeys.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怨みは夜の帳に包まれて\"},{\"title\":\"Pandemonium\",\"number\":166,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Natsu punches out Dobengal, the guild member summoned to fight him, he and Jiemma engage in a duel. However, the guild master`s daughter Minerva appears, ends their duel and, taking Happy hostage, convinces Natsu to settle their dispute in the Grand Magic Games.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伏魔殿[パンデモニウム]\"},{\"title\":\"100 Against 1\",\"number\":167,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Erza kills the 100 monsters using various types of armor to match their strength and weaknesses. As a result, the crowd praises Fairy Tail, and the guild is awarded with 10 points.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"100対1\"},{\"title\":\"Laxus vs. Alexei\",\"number\":168,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the battle portion of the Grand Magic Games` third day, Milliana of Mermaid Heel beats Semmes of Quatro Puppy while Sabertooth`s Rufus swiftly defeats Blue Pegasus` Eve. For the third match, Laxus of Fairy Tail Team B is chosen to battle against Alexei of Team Raven Tail.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ラクサスvs.アレクセイ\"},{\"title\":\"Wendy vs. Shelia\",\"number\":169,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Laxus defeats Ivan and the four Raven Tail elite members, Ivan`s illusions disappear to the shock of everyone in the stadium. The game officials declare Laxus the victor, and Ivan tells him that Lumen Histoire is Fairy Tail’s `darkness`.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウェンディ vs. シェリア\"},{\"title\":\"Small Fists\",\"number\":170,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Cheria being fully healed and Wendy being almost depleted of magic power, their battle continues, with the former casting a high-level spell towards the latter. However, it seems that Wendy enhances Cheria`s physical strength, causing the attack to gain much force and thus missing Wendy.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"小さな拳\"},{\"title\":\"Naval Battle\",\"number\":171,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the jubilant Fairy Tail members celebrate their victories, the other people, such as Sting, Kagura, and Milliana, are contemplating on their own concerns, while Yukino is enlisted as a sergeant under Arcadios` command.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海戦[ナバルバトル]\"},{\"title\":\"A Parfum for You\",\"number\":172,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Lucy is hospitalized and taken to the infirmary, the Fairy Tail members warn Sabertooth that they have angered the worst possible guild to do so.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"君に捧げる香り[パルファム]\"},{\"title\":\"Battle of Dragon Slayers!\",\"number\":173,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mermaid Heel`s Kagura and Milliana and Lamia Scale`s Lyon and Yuka face off for the second tag battle of the games.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"バトル・オブ・ドラゴンスレイヤー\"},{\"title\":\"Four Dragons\",\"number\":174,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The tag battle continues, with Sting and Rogue beginning to attack Natsu and Gajeel with their powers being increased.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四人の竜[ドラゴン]\"},{\"title\":\"Natsu vs. the Twin Dragons\",\"number\":175,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The tag battle of the Dragon Slayers comes to a close, with Natsu intrepidly overpowering the combined attacks of Sting and Rogue. The Sabertooth members watch in dismay, whilst Jiemma seethes in anger over the defeat of the Twin Dragons, causing the nearby spectators to be frightened away.\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツvs.双竜\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}